69	 * One line of the timeline: a step, a counted group of steps, or a milestone. Memoized on the entry's identity, so a streaming
70	 * update re-renders only the rows that changed. Only the newest running step animates; other running steps keep a calm dot.
71	 * A group folds into one counted line whose disclosure lists every call, and an execution, diff or artifact call opens its
